  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Commonwealth Secretariat Election Observer Mission to Zimbabwe August 2023</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">This one-off grant funds the Commonwealth Secretariat election observer mission to Zimbabwe for August 2023 elections. Although Zimbabwe is not currently a Commonwealth member, the Commonwealth Observer Group&#x2019;s findings and recommendations will help to inform a possible future decision by Commonwealth members on whether to readmit Zimbabwe, and will also help Zimbabwe improve their electoral capability and future elections.</narrative>
  </description>
